# 1.3: Ombak as made plays at power-on (GILAK), the ensemble leading its own core melody: it moves (many tones),
# lands on the first tone at every gong; a white key takes the lead at once; a cycle without one, and the ensemble
# leads again. THE MELODY off (GAMELAN), and the core waits for you
factory
listen
wait 500
expect playing 1
expect p0 5
expect self 1
corereset
wait 40000
expect cores_seen >4
expect gong_lands >3
expect gong_lands_off 0
expect clips 0
shot leads.png
# you lead
tapkey w3
wait 1500
expect self 0
expect core 3
wait 3000
expect self 0
# a cycle (8 beats at 60) without a key: the ensemble again
wait 9000
expect self 1
# THE MELODY off: it holds your note
set self 0
tapkey w2
wait 20000
expect self 0
expect core 2
